        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Express <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^{-1}]</span> as a fraction in its simplest form.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Express [MATH: 3^{-1}] as a fraction in its simplest form.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The expression <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^{-1}]</span> means the reciprocal of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3]</span>. Hence</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^{-1} = \\dfrac{1}{3}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "The expression [MATH: 3^{-1}] means the reciprocal of [MATH: 3]. Hence\n\n[MATH: 3^{-1} = \\dfrac{1}{3}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nExpress [MATH: 3^{-1}] as a fraction in its simplest form.\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nThe expression [MATH: 3^{-1}] means the reciprocal of [MATH: 3]. Hence\n\n[MATH: 3^{-1} = \\dfrac{1}{3}.]"
      },
